WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.350
This video covers discharge
and follow-up on iPhone.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.520
Open the Discharge tab and read what the

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:07.670
client will receive
before you send anything.

00:00:08.213 --> 00:00:10.683
Tap the send button to start an email,

00:00:10.853 --> 00:00:13.083
then tap the sender to choose a route.

00:00:13.173 --> 00:00:17.243
Every account can send a one-way
email that the client can't reply to.

00:00:17.333 --> 00:00:20.363
With Nest, you can send through
a private relay address.

00:00:20.888 --> 00:00:23.048
Replies then come back to the encounter.

00:00:23.048 --> 00:00:25.838
Nest also lets you send
from your personal email.

00:00:25.928 --> 00:00:28.158
Here we cancel, so nothing is sent.

00:00:28.727 --> 00:00:31.287
Replies sent through Nest appear
in the encounter's Messages

00:00:31.287 --> 00:00:34.077
tab, so the conversation
stays with the visit.
